Test data:
  tests/data/identify_corpus.jsonl contains identification strings (sysObjectID, sysDescr,
  model names) as emitted by network devices, gathered from public SNMP recordings of the
  LibreNMS project (https://github.com/librenms/librenms, GPL-3.0). Only these factual
  device strings are used, for testing; no LibreNMS file, code or classification is included,
  and the test data is not part of the installed package.
